A||||10||Red2m4||What your car says about you.||||10||
Z||000000||Red2m4||11-21-2000||03:17 PM||||I found this at <A HREF="http://www.cobraforum.com." TARGET=_blank>www.cobraforum.com.</A> <P>Can any on think of any for the Fiero?<P><BR>My Car Speaks For Itself<BR>Does your car make a statement? Probably so. Here's a list of cars and the<BR>statements they make on their drivers' behalf. <P>Acura Integra <BR>I have always wanted to own the Buick of sports cars. <P>Acura Legend <BR>I'm too bland for German cars. <P>Acura NSX <BR>I have problems with my...er....manhood but I make lots of money!<P>AMC Gremlin <BR>I could only afford three-fourths of a AMC Hornet. <P>AMC Pacer <BR>My father wouldn' t buy me a Camaro. <P>AG Hummer<BR>I wear camouflage, especially to the paint-ball games and I have a $5,000<BR>aviator watch on my wrist.<P>Audi 90 <BR>I enjoy putting out engine fires. <P>Austin-Healey 3000 <BR>I can put raw meat on the transmission hump and have a well done steak by<BR>the time I arrive anywhere. <P>BMW (any)<BR>My car/house/wife/kids/job/laptop/stereo/portfolio is better than yours.<BR>Deal with it.<P>Buick Park Avenue <BR>I am older than 34 of the 50 states. <P>Buick Riviera Convertible <BR>I'm not very smart, and I look like it too. <P>Buick Electra <BR>Hey, it's 30-year old technology. But it's GOOD 30-year old technology. <P>Buick Reatta <BR>I like impractical and boring cars with a T.V. screen in the dash.<P>Cadillac Cimarron <BR>I am stupid enough to pay extra money for an Chevrolet Cavilier with<BR>leather. <P>Cadillac Eldorado <BR>I am a very good Mary Kay salesman. <P>Cadillac Seville <BR>I am a pimp. <P>Chevrolet Camaro <BR>I enjoy beating up people and I have a pack of Marlboros rolled up in my<BR>T-shirt sleeve. <P>Chevrolet Chevette <BR>I like seeing people's reactions when I tell them I have a 'Vette. <P>Chevrolet Corvette <BR>I'm in a mid-life crisis. <P>Chevrolet El Camino <BR>I am leading a militia to overthrow the government. <P>Chrysler 5th Ave <BR>Did the pushpins come free with the headliner? <P>Chrysler Cordoba <BR>I dig the rich Corinthian leather.<P>Chrysler Sebring Convertible<BR>My girlfriend made me buy it. <P>Datsun 280Z <BR>I have a kilo of cocaine in my wheel well. <P>Dodge Charger <BR>Reliable is boring. My car is exciting. <P>Dodge Dart <BR>I teach third grade special education and I voted for Eisenhower. <P>Dodge Daytona <BR>I delivered pizza for four years to get this car. <P>Ford Explorer<BR>My new extended family has kids included.<P>Ford Fairmont <BR>(See Dodge Dart) <P>Ford Mustang <BR>I slow down to 85 in school zones. <P>Ford Crown Victoria <BR>I enjoy having people slow to 55mph and change lanes when I pull up behind<BR>them. <P>Geo Storm <BR>I will start the 11th grade in the Fall. <P>Geo Tracker <BR>I will start the 12th grade in the Fall. <P>Honda Accord <BR>Well, they MUST be good. Everyone ELSE owns one.<P>Honda Civic <BR>I have just graduated and have no credit. <P>Honda CRV<BR>I'm a soccer mom.<P>Honda del Sol <BR>I have always said, half a convertible is better than no convertible at all.<P><BR>Infiniti Q45 <BR>I am a physician with 17 malpractice suits pending. <P>Isuzu Impulse <BR>I do not give a rip about J.D. Power or his reports.<P>Jaguar XJ6 / XJ12 <BR>I am so rich I will pay 60K for a car that is in the shop 280 days per year.<P><BR>Jeep Wrangler <BR>I am fiercely independent, just like all my friends with Jeeps. <P>Kia Sephia <BR>I learned nothing from the failure of Daihatsu. <P>Lotus Esprit <BR>Ever pay $2000 for a tune up? I do. Woo-HOO! <P>Lincoln Town Car <BR>I live for bingo and covered dish suppers. <P>Mazda Miata <BR>I do not fear being decapitated by an eighteen-wheeler. <P>Mazda RX-7<BR>I have the only rotory engine car in the world! That gets 15 m.p.g.<P>Mercedes 500SL <BR>I will beat you up if you ask me for an autograph. <P>Mercedes SUV<BR>(see BMW)<P>MGB <BR>I am dating a mechanic. <P>Mitsubishi Diamante <BR>I don't know what it means either. <P>Mitsubishi GT3000<BR>Why accelerate? Because you can! <P>Nissan 300ZX <BR>I have yet to complete my divorce proceedings. <P>Oldsmobile Cutlass <BR>I just stole this car and I'm going to make a fortune off the parts. <P>Peugeot 505 Diesel <BR>I am on the EPA's Ten Most Wanted List. <P>Plymouth Fury <BR>I like driving an air-conditioned sofa that can carry your car in my trunk<BR>as a spare. <P>Plymouth Neon <BR>I sincerely enjoy doing the Macarena. <P>Pontiac Trans AM <BR>I have a switchblade in my sock. <P>Porsche 911 / 924 / 944 / 928 <BR>I am dating big haired women that otherwise would be inaccessible to me. <P>Renault 2CV<BR>Well then YOUR car's a piece of ****  too.<P>Rolls Royce Silver Shadow <BR>I think Pat Buchanan is a tad too liberal. <P>Subaru Legacy <BR>I have always wanted a Japanese car even more inferior than Isuzu. <P>Triumph TR6 <BR>I am an amateur mechanic who enjoys a challenge. <P>Toyota Camry <BR>I am still in the closet. <P>Toyota Truck (male)<BR>I am a painter, carpenter, plumber, etc. during the week and I like to<BR>boony-crash my truck on weekends.<P>Toyota Truck (female)<BR>I'm a tomboy.<P>Toyota MR-2<BR>I pay more in insurance premiums than you do! na-na-nah-na-nahh-na!<P>Toyota Supra<BR>I couldn't afford a Porsche.<P>Volkswagon Beetle <BR>I still watch Partridge Family reruns (C'mon everybody, let's get<BR>HAPPPPPEEEY). <P>Volkswagon Cabriolet <BR>I am out of the closet. <P>VW Rabbit GTi <BR>My mom won't let me buy a Porsche 'til I finish Algebra. <P>VW Jetta <BR>I stopped smoking pot when I got a real job after college. I swear. <P>Volkswagon Microbus <BR>I am having flashbacks (a free one) right now. <P>Volvo 740 Wagon <BR>I am frightened of my wife. <P>Volvo 240 <BR>Other drivers are unsafe. Let me go ahead and pull out in front of this guy<BR>to slow him down.<P>Volvo S80<BR>Sure I'll pay $60,000 for a Swedish convertible and never take the top down.<P>              Hey, had to add the smilies, I drive a VW Beetle!<BR>||||reg||10
Z||000001||2xsess||11-21-2000||09:07 PM||||ROFLMAO...hahaha that's too funny. I almost choked on my pepsi.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>How about this for the Fiero...Yes I am the top tupperware salesperson in my division.<P>or I love seeing the blank looks on peoples faces when I tell them what I drive.<P>Ahh well, my wife never said she married me for my sense of humor.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Jeff||||reg||14
Z||000002||Cheever2||11-22-2000||03:53 AM||||<BR>Some were very funny, some were not.  But they were better than anything I could do, so it gets the thumbs up.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Cheever2 (edited 11-22-2000).]||||reg||14
Z||000003||Black88GT||11-22-2000||09:24 AM||||That Jaguar one is so true.  I know someone just like that.  I think the Toyota Camry one should say "see honda accord"<P>that was great<P><BR><P>------------------<BR>Jeff<BR>'88 GT t-top 3.4<BR>Baltimore, MD<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/cartmanico.gif">           <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kennyico.gif">         <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/stanico.gif">       <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/kyleico.gif">           <IMG SRC="http://cgi.tripod.com/smilecwm/cgi-bin/s/sp/chefico.gif"> ||||reg||10
Z||000004||Tigger||11-22-2000||10:23 AM||||I liked the Cimarron one...  Here's my version<P>Cadillac Escalade<BR>Hey look, I paid 10,000 more for a Tahoe with OnStar and leather seats.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P> <IMG SRC="http://www.cadillac.com/escalade/images/photo1.jpg"> <P>I never thought of the day where $50,000 could buy you something so butt ugly as this.<P>||||reg||1
