Z||000010||Cooter||11-23-2000||11:58 AM||||In my workplace, no one has an appreciation for unique cars. When the conservative co-workers see my car, they just wonder why I am such a non-conformist. I guess my car says: Here I am, I don't care what you think!||||reg||1
